{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.20260527141711","title":"Chapter 6 Enoch: kosmos terungkap sebagai arsitektur yang punya jalur dan tempat untuk setiap elemen","desc":"Bagian awal Chapter 6 menempatkan Enoch sebagai saksi yang dibawa melihat struktur tersembunyi kosmos—api, gelap, air, angin, bintang, dan jalur malaikat.","updated":1779935953104,"created":1779865840296,"tags":["zettel","enoch","cosmology","order","path"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.20260527141711","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"40e298d966c773f93d579c6a139db855","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260527141711","id":"zettel.20260527141711","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260527141711","id":"zettel.20260527141711","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.enoch","alias":"enoch","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.enoch"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260527141711","id":"zettel.20260527141711","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.cosmology","alias":"cosmology","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.cosmology"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260527141711","id":"zettel.20260527141711","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.order","alias":"order","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.order"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260527141711","id":"zettel.20260527141711","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.path","alias":"path","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.path"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260527141711","id":"zettel.20260527141711","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.literature.the-complete-book-of-enoch-chapter-6","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":3,"offset":807},"end":{"line":9,"column":61,"offset":865},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.literature.the-complete-book-of-enoch-chapter-6"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.literature.the-complete-book-of-enoch-chapter-6","id":"zettel.literature.the-complete-book-of-enoch-chapter-6","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":3,"offset":2692},"end":{"line":33,"column":28,"offset":2717},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.20260527141711"},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.literature.the-complete-book-of-enoch-chapter-7","id":"zettel.literature.the-complete-book-of-enoch-chapter-7","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":30,"column":3,"offset":2684},"end":{"line":30,"column":28,"offset":2709},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.20260527141711"}],"anchors":{},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"chapter-6-enoch-kosmos-terungkap-sebagai-arsitektur-yang-punya-jalur-dan-tempat-untuk-setiap-elemen\">Chapter 6 Enoch: kosmos terungkap sebagai arsitektur yang punya jalur dan tempat untuk setiap elemen<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#chapter-6-enoch-kosmos-terungkap-sebagai-arsitektur-yang-punya-jalur-dan-tempat-untuk-setiap-elemen\"></a></h1>\n<p>Dalam bagian awal Chapter 6, Enoch bukan lagi berada di sidang surgawi. Dia dibawa malaikat melihat \"ruang mesin\" kosmos: sumber api, tempat kegelapan, sungai api, living waters, fumus angin, dan jalur para malaikat.</p>\n<p>Inti idenya adalah bahwa dunia Enoch bukan sekadar kumpulan peristiwa moral. Ia adalah sistem yang berlapis-lapis dengan tempat, jalur, dan fungsi untuk setiap unsur. Api, air, angin, dan bintang tidak bergerak acak; mereka ada di \"treasuries\", \"pillars\", \"corner-stone\", dan \"paths\".</p>\n<p>Ini membuat pelanggaran Watchers terasa lebih serius. Kalau dosa mereka hanya soal hukum moral pribadi, bisa ditangani oleh penghakiman biasa. Tapi dalam kosmos yang tertata seperti ini, pelanggaran berarti keluar dari jalur yang ditentukan oleh arsitektur realitas itu sendiri.</p>\n<p>Referensi internal:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.the-complete-book-of-enoch-chapter-6\">The Complete Book of Enoch Chapter 6 sebagai literature note</a> — literature note untuk Chapter 6 dan kosmologi Enoch.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">enoch (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">cosmology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">order (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">path (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.the-complete-book-of-enoch-chapter-6\">The Complete Book of Enoch Chapter 6 sebagai literature note</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.the-complete-book-of-enoch-chapter-7\">The Complete Book of Enoch Chapter 7 sebagai literature note</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"fi